{"unit_id":"ziyulisiyuan__dsh-plugin-random#card-zh","repo":"ziyulisiyuan/dsh-plugin-random","commit":"ffc63df51cdf5b0b2bd55c2ea4f09ac6bfacfa76","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-random 是面向 DSH Host agent 的随机数据工具插件：它通过 tools 服务注册五个工具，并向系统提示加入调用指引。主要功能包括范围内批量随机数、按字符集生成字符串、生成随机字节和 UUID v4，以及无偏打乱数组；随机数支持种子复现，适合抽样、测试数据和随机标识等场景。工具使用 Node 内置加密随机源，无需 API 密钥或外部服务；使用前需由 DSH Host 提供 tools 与 systemPrompt 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1-5","index.js:164-309"]}
{"unit_id":"ziyulisiyuan__dsh-plugin-random#card-en","repo":"ziyulisiyuan/dsh-plugin-random","commit":"ffc63df51cdf5b0b2bd55c2ea4f09ac6bfacfa76","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-random gives DSH agents five tools for random numbers, strings, bytes, UUIDs, and shuffling. It supports batched or seeded numbers and custom alphabets. It uses Node crypto without API keys or external services; DSH provides the required host services.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1-5","index.js:164-309"]}
