{"unit_id":"ziyulisiyuan__dsh-plugin-random#feature-numbers","repo":"ziyulisiyuan/dsh-plugin-random","commit":"ffc63df51cdf5b0b2bd55c2ea4f09ac6bfacfa76","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-random 的功能「范围随机数」：范围随机数：可生成区间内的整数或浮点数，并一次返回多项；可选 uint32 种子用于模拟复现。调用 random_number，传入 min、max 和可选参数。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:60-102"]}
{"unit_id":"ziyulisiyuan__dsh-plugin-random#feature-strings","repo":"ziyulisiyuan/dsh-plugin-random","commit":"ffc63df51cdf5b0b2bd55c2ea4f09ac6bfacfa76","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-random 的功能「随机字符串」：随机字符串：按指定长度从命名字符集组合或自定义 Unicode 字符中逐位抽取。调用 random_string 并传入 length，以及可选 sets 或 chars。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:104-135"]}
{"unit_id":"ziyulisiyuan__dsh-plugin-random#feature-bytes","repo":"ziyulisiyuan/dsh-plugin-random","commit":"ffc63df51cdf5b0b2bd55c2ea4f09ac6bfacfa76","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-random 的功能「随机字节」：生成 1 至 4096 字节的随机数据，可编码为 hex、base64 或 base64url。调用 random_bytes 并传入长度及可选编码。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:137-143"]}
{"unit_id":"ziyulisiyuan__dsh-plugin-random#feature-uuid","repo":"ziyulisiyuan/dsh-plugin-random","commit":"ffc63df51cdf5b0b2bd55c2ea4f09ac6bfacfa76","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-random 的功能「UUID 生成」：UUID 生成：调用 random_uuid 即可得到一个 UUID v4 字符串，版本与变体位由 Node crypto.randomUUID 设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:145-148"]}
{"unit_id":"ziyulisiyuan__dsh-plugin-random#feature-shuffle","repo":"ziyulisiyuan/dsh-plugin-random","commit":"ffc63df51cdf5b0b2bd55c2ea4f09ac6bfacfa76","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-random 的功能「数组洗牌」：数组洗牌：对最多 10000 项的数组执行 Fisher-Yates 随机重排，返回新数组且保留原输入。调用 random_shuffle 并传入 items。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:150-162"]}
